+**Worktree.** Work from a git worktree off main. Create and assign a separate worktree explicitly for each writer, and put its absolute path in the native subagent brief. Native spawning does not provision or switch worktrees. For sequential reuse, the upstream cleanup option is `git fetch && git reset --hard origin/<branch>` between them. Dirty branch with unrelated work: patch out, fresh worktree, apply. Snarled worktree: reset from main, redo minimally.
